# Generated training artifacts. We ignore the directory by default and force-add
# only the curated set we want to ship (see `git add -f` in the release flow):
#   artifacts/baseline/*       — real LR baseline metrics + small joblib weights
#   artifacts/resnet/*         — ResNet-1D weights + metrics
#   artifacts/smoke/*          — synthetic smoke artifacts (small, deterministic)
#   artifacts/comparison.md    — model comparison table
